- Fit and get augmented values for full model:

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
mod_full1 = gapm %>% 
  lm(formula = life_exp ~ cell_phones_100 + vax_rate)
aug_full1  = augment(mod_full1)
```
:::


- Calculate the deviances for each model:

::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
SS_df2 = gapm %>% select(life_exp) %>%
  mutate(SSY_diff_r1 = life_exp - mean(life_exp),
         SSR_diff_r1 = aug_red1$.fitted - mean(life_exp), 
         SSE_diff_r1 = aug_red1$.resid, 
         SSY_diff_f1 = life_exp - mean(life_exp),
         SSR_diff_f1 = aug_full1$.fitted - mean(life_exp), 
         SSE_diff_f1 = aug_full1$.resid)
```
:::


